vmUSD is a vault token issued by MetaMask. Each vmUSD is a share in a
vault that holds mUSD, MetaMask's US dollar stablecoin, and the share price
rises as the vault earns yield. See {% link href="https://docs.veda.tech/"
title="vault provider documentation" /%} for more.

